PCRE is easy to compile on Windows using MinGW, and it has a POSIX
interface if you want it (pcreposix.h, libpcreposix). :-)

There's also a precompiled PCRE for Windows built by the gnuwin32
folks (devel files for MinGW and VC++ are included):

